paths: proto/kagent/api/v1alpha1/{common.proto,runtime.proto,sessions.proto,agents.proto,scheduled_runs.proto,checkpoints.proto}
notes: |
  Proto source copied verbatim (service definitions included; the previous
  server/third_party/kagentapi vendored message-only .pb.go files, with no RPCs).
  Go and Connect clients are generated from these by `go generate ./...`, driven by
  server/tools/kagentproto (protocompile + protoc-gen-go + protoc-gen-connect-go; no
  buf CLI, since buf.yaml's module deps need BSR access this tree does not have).

  TestSourcePinnedToDeployedRevision (in this package) fails if the commit above
  stops matching the sourceRevision that oldsj/infrastructure's
  k8s/apps/kagent/source-lock.yaml points controller-runtime at. Update both
  together.

  To refresh by hand from a fork checkout:
    commit=<new commit>
    fork=~/dev/kagent   # or wherever the oldsj/kagent fork is checked out
    dest=server/third_party/kagentproto/kagent/api/v1alpha1
    for f in common runtime sessions agents scheduled_runs checkpoints; do
      git -C "$fork" show "$commit:proto/kagent/api/v1alpha1/$f.proto" >"$dest/$f.proto"
    done
  then update the commit above and run `go generate ./...` from server/.
